; Hrimfell - an open-world Nordic action RPG for the Nokia 9300
; (v0.4.82) the program only (~300 KB): the world's data is its own package, hrimfell_data.pkg (skyrim_data.sis),
; installed once and again only when the data changes. First time from a package with the data in it: this one
; first (its upgrade removes the old package's files, the data with them), then skyrim_data.sis.
&EN
#{"Hrimfell"},(0x0E3D9301),0,4,82
(0x101F8ED2), 0, 0, 0, {"Series80ProductID"}
"../build/hrimfell.app"-"C:\system\apps\hrimfell\hrimfell.app"
"../build/hrimfell.rsc"-"C:\system\apps\hrimfell\hrimfell.rsc"
"../build/hrimfell.aif"-"C:\system\apps\hrimfell\hrimfell.aif"
